algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm CollisionCertificate(w₁, w₂, N):
  Input: Words w₁, w₂, modulus N
  Output: Certificate of collision/separation

  D ← (M_{w₁} - M_{w₂}) mod N
  if D = 0:
    return "Universal collision: M_{w₁} ≡ M_{w₂} (mod N)"
  for j in {0, 1, 2}:
    if D · eⱼ ≢ 0 (mod N):
      return "Separated by basis vector eⱼ"

  Complexity: O(ℓ) matrix products + O(1) tests
